{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109518","id":3308600385,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7FNTxB","number":109518,"title":"XRServer.GetTrackers doesn't return all the available trackers","user":{"login":"mysticfall","id":2367032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjcwMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2367032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall","html_url":"https://github.com/mysticfall","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mysticfall/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-08-11T06:14:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T17:40:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nArch Linux, NVidia RTX4070 Ti Super, WiVRn/Envision\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I enable the full-body tracking feature on both my Quest 3 and WiVRn, I can see that the server program (i.e. WiVRn server on Envision) correctly registers additional trackers as shown below:\n\n<img width=\"606\" height=\"684\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f16dcf69-30a5-48da-96a9-a8fa7dd04b65\" />\n\nHowever, the following code (C#) only reports trackers for the headset and two controllers:\n```c#\nXRServer.GetTrackers((int)XRServer.TrackerType.Any);\n```\n\nI'm not sure if it's a bug or a missing feature. Either way, it'd be nice to be able to access all the available trackers, so users can create games with full-body tracking support using Godot.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable the body-tracking support on a headset (e.g. Quest 3).\n2. Query the available trackers from Godot as shown above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```gdscript\nXRServer.get_trackers(255);\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109518/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}